Welcome to FoxoOS 0.1.0-alpha
Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie) base system

FoxoOS uses sysvinit-core as PID 1 and OpenRC for services.
The systemd service manager is not installed.

  rc-status                 show OpenRC services
  rc-service <name> status  show one service
  ip -br a                  network addresses
  cat /etc/os-release       OS identification

Documentation and build scripts: /usr/local/share/foxoos/
